OL,3,GNEWSAFirst files in Drumcree protest
OL,4,Ainvestigation to be sent to PPS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first files in the Drumcree protest
OL,7,Finvestigation are due to go to the
OL,8,FPublic Prosecution Service (PPS) in a
OL,9,Fnumber of days, the chief constable Jon
OL,10,FBoutcher has told the Policing Board.
OL,12,FProtests on Garvaghy Road in October
OL,13,Fblocked a contentious Orange Order
OL,14,Fparade, which a court had ruled could
OL,15,Fgo ahead, from passing along the mainly
OL,16,Fnationalist street in Portadown, County
OL,17,FArmagh.
OL,19,FBoutcher said that the number of people
OL,20,Fsuspected of criminal offences in
OL,21,Fconnection with the Drumcree protest
OL,22,Fhas risen to 65.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
